Dialogue: 99,0:00:30.25,0:00:32.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's been a while, Holy Sword Wielder.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:32.84,0:00:35.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hasn't it been seven days since we last met?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:38.33,0:00:40.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You sure don't like to talk.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:40.82,0:00:43.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sajou Ayaka only has three more days to live.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:44.55,0:00:49.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My Master told me to simply watch\Nyou both as you perish eventually, but...
Dialogue: 99,0:00:54.69,0:00:56.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you want it, come get it.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:21.54,0:01:25.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The countdown to my death sentence reached zero.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:31.50,0:01:35.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Today is the death anniversary of my dad and older sister.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:41.77,0:01:43.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is just my self-assessment...
Dialogue: 99,0:01:46.29,0:01:48.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...but I have a terrible personality.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:49.78,0:01:55.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm gloomy, cowardly, narrow-minded, and a show-off.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:58.77,0:02:00.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And, worst of all...
Dialogue: 99,0:02:04.97,0:02:07.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm hopelessly average...
Dialogue: 99,0:02:08.36,0:02:09.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...so average.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:19.07,0:02:22.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wasn't able to obey my father's orders this morning.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:24.40,0:02:27.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I ended up using my own blood instead.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:39.80,0:02:43.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm extremely sorry about what happened to your family.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:46.09,0:02:49.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They were so close to finding the Truth, too{\fscx300}-
Dialogue: 99,0:02:49.17,0:02:50.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please leave.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:51.92,0:02:54.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,At midnight tonight, eight years will have passed.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:55.22,0:03:01.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can finally restart the battle, but\Nwhy haven't you made any preparations?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:02.18,0:03:03.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 99,0:03:04.73,0:03:06.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't want anything to do with the Grail.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:07.69,0:03:10.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All things are subject to cause and effect.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:13.27,0:03:14.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You have nowhere to run.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:17.20,0:03:19.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Like I'd become one of them!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:19.98,0:03:21.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,To begin with, I can't do it!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:21.90,0:03:23.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's no way I can do it!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:24.39,0:03:26.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't do what my sister did!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:26.87,0:03:28.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It has nothing to do with me!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:34.94,0:03:37.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're the lady of this house?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:37.15,0:03:38.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Go away!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:43.08,0:03:45.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That black magic's pretty old-style.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:46.09,0:03:47.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's kinda a waste, though.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:56.46,0:03:58.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,S-Save me...
Dialogue: 99,0:03:59.25,0:04:00.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...Dad!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:55.69,0:04:58.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not bad at all, Black Mage!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:02.04,0:05:03.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bastard!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:15.07,0:05:19.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You possess Command Spells, so anyone would pay you a visit.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:19.08,0:05:24.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}So you're one of the seven chosen by the Grail?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:20.25,0:05:23.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What'd you expect from a hastily-made spear?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:21.75,0:05:24.13,Dialogue Overlap,,0,0,0,,Got it? Kill her, Lancer.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:24.13,0:05:26.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I already said I don't want to fight!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:26.24,0:05:28.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why do you keep pestering me?!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:27.09,0:05:29.64,Dialogue Overlap,,0,0,0,,This battle is very much to my liking.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:28.28,0:05:29.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Have you forgotten our pact?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:29.64,0:05:33.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}It's marvelous how Heroic Spirits can fight each other for treasure!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:29.97,0:05:31.31,Dialogue Overlap,,0,0,0,,They'll kill me...
Dialogue: 99,0:05:30.58,0:05:33.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your Master will be blamed for the unnecessary massacre.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:31.31,0:05:32.85,Dialogue Overlap,,0,0,0,,No... No!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:32.85,0:05:34.76,Dialogue Overlap,,0,0,0,,No! No! No!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:33.50,0:05:36.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How unlucky of you to be in these premises.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:36.42,0:05:37.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll relieve you.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:37.81,0:05:41.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I would've rather had a happy individual than a misfortunate Hero.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:38.83,0:05:40.19,Dialogue Overlap,,0,0,0,,Please don't get the wrong idea.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:39.10,0:05:40.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Oh, wow.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:40.80,0:05:45.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Since when was my Servant more useless than a dog?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:42.06,0:05:46.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It can grant wishes? Did you really believe in such a fairy tale?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:47.23,0:05:51.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I am the single most powerful Heroic Spirit in existence!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:49.79,0:05:52.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A Master to suffer divine punishment hasn't existed for a long time.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:52.68,0:05:55.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Six Wings?! Are you the Second Master?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:55.53,0:05:58.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So you killed your own Master.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:58.21,0:05:59.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You coward!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:59.07,0:06:01.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right before she died, I made her use all her Command Spells...
Dialogue: 99,0:06:01.88,0:06:05.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll crush your skull with my own hand.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:04.24,0:06:07.67,Dialogue Overlap,,0,0,0,,Dad only had expectations for my sister.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:08.23,0:06:10.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I didn't have any friends.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:10.75,0:06:13.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It was so that I could have true incarnation.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:13.48,0:06:17.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As for me, I want a Hero who was killed by a woman.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:17.58,0:06:18.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Because...
Dialogue: 99,0:06:18.92,0:06:21.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...he'd know just how scary women are.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:21.18,0:06:24.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm free. I'm not bound by any Master.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:21.97,0:06:23.60,Dialogue Overlap,,0,0,0,,You've been lying to me all this time!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:22.21,0:06:26.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I loathe them so much!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:24.56,0:06:28.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The wish of a fulfilled person must be a happy one, right?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:26.64,0:06:28.70,Dialogue Overlap,,0,0,0,,I like you better, Ayaka.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:27.41,0:06:31.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}How pretentious of you to obtain Saber.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:28.12,0:06:30.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Young girl, please take the oath.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:30.50,0:06:34.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm anomalous!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:34.47,0:06:37.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is the true method of using the Grail.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:36.36,0:06:39.78,Dialogue Overlap,,0,0,0,,He wished for the happiness of everyone.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:37.29,0:06:39.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's the bridge to the Root.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:38.71,0:06:41.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}It's not a belief. It's the truth.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:39.36,0:06:42.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've been connected to it ever since I was born.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:39.78,0:06:42.78,Dialogue Overlap,,0,0,0,,For his sake, I'll kill all of you.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:42.33,0:06:45.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Holy Grail serves as a bridge to the Root.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:45.50,0:06:53.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I detest orientals, especially the Japanese.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:45.62,0:06:47.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll defeat Saber.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:47.29,0:06:49.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,After that, you shall be my queen!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:49.04,0:06:51.07,Dialogue Overlap,,0,0,0,,I knew that eight years ago.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:51.57,0:06:53.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I may be useless.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:53.07,0:06:57.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Both process and result are separate and independent human wills.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:54.21,0:06:55.48,Dialogue Overlap,,0,0,0,,But I'll fight.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:56.39,0:07:01.73,Dialogue Overlap,,0,0,0,,Even if I'm useless, at least I can choose to fight!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:58.61,0:07:02.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There are times when the decision itself is the answer.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:02.23,0:07:06.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come forth, Saber!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:11.15,0:07:13.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Grail isn't meant to be filled with blood.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:14.72,0:07:20.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I hear it's made to collect miracles with\Nno observable form, the wishes of people.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:21.90,0:07:26.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When it is filled, the Lord's Glory will flow forth.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:28.45,0:07:30.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That makes it the complete opposite.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:31.34,0:07:35.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The fact that the Grail won't activate\Nunless it has collected enough wishes...
Dialogue: 99,0:07:35.14,0:07:36.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's just as you say.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:37.44,0:07:40.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Grail is conceived through human thought.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:41.30,0:07:43.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But it's really quite tragic.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:44.72,0:07:47.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The majority of people wish not with good intentions,
Dialogue: 99,0:07:48.20,0:07:50.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but with evil intentions under the name of greed.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:52.25,0:07:57.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,From the very start, the Grail is corrupt.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:01.41,0:08:03.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Prepare yourself for this!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:06.90,0:08:08.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Face the heavens!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:12.37,0:08:14.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The flames of destruction are filled.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:15.04,0:08:16.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is the moment of reckoning!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:45.87,0:08:47.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Holy Sword Wielder?!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:54.75,0:08:56.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ex...
Dialogue: 99,0:08:57.76,0:08:59.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bastard!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:59.38,0:09:01.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...calibur!
Dialogue: 99,0:09:18.32,0:09:19.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm Saber.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:22.49,0:09:24.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A Servant that will protect you.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:46.71,0:11:48.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ahh, Saber.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:48.43,0:11:51.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Saber. Saber. Saber!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:52.21,0:11:56.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I had faith that you would come back one day!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:58.27,0:11:59.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I love you.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:00.95,0:12:02.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My...
Dialogue: 99,0:12:02.07,0:12:05.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My prince, you belong only to me!
